{"seq":1,"slug":"business-administration","title":"工商管理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/management/business-administration","introMarkdown":"# 工商管理 简介\n\n工商管理研究的是如何在资源有限的条件下，组织人力、资本和信息来创造价值并实现组织目标。从街角的咖啡店到跨国科技巨头，任何商业组织都面临着相同的基本问题：顾客需要什么、如何比竞争对手做得更好、怎样让团队高效协作。工商管理提供的正是分析和应对这些问题的思维框架。\n\n这门学科的魅力在于它的综合性。你需要理解人的行为动机，掌握市场竞争的规律，熟悉运营流程的优化逻辑，还要培养在不确定性中做决策的判断力。它不像自然科学那样追求唯一正确的答案，而更强调在具体情境中找到最合理的行动方案。\n\n本学习空间将工商管理的核心领域组织为四个章节。**第一章 管理学原理** 从组织理论、领导力与激励、战略管理三个维度，建立管理思维的基本框架。**第二章 市场营销** 探讨消费者行为的驱动因素、营销策略的制定逻辑以及数字时代的营销新实践。**第三章 运营管理** 关注价值创造的执行层面，涵盖供应链管理、质量管理和精益生产等提升运营效率的方法。**第四章 创业管理** 聚焦从零到一的过程，讨论创业战略、商业模式设计和风险投资的基本逻辑。\n\n工商管理最有效的学习方式是案例分析。建议在学习每个概念时，尝试用它去分析一家你熟悉的企业——它的战略选择、营销打法、运营模式——这种理论与实际的对照能帮助你真正内化管理思维。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"management-principles","title":"管理学原理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/management-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"organizational-theory","title":"大学工商管理 — 组织理论","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/management-principles/organizational-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"leadership-motivation","title":"大学工商管理 — 领导力与激励","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/management-principles/leadership-motivation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"strategic-management","title":"大学工商管理 — 战略管理","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/management-principles/strategic-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"marketing","title":"市场营销","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/marketing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"marketing-principles","title":"大学工商管理 — 市场营销原理","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/marketing/marketing-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"consumer-behavior","title":"大学工商管理 — 消费者行为","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/marketing/consumer-behavior"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-marketing","title":"大学工商管理 — 数字营销","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/marketing/digital-marketing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"operations-management","title":"运营管理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/operations-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-chain-management","title":"大学工商管理 — 供应链管理","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/operations-management/supply-chain-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quality-management","title":"大学工商管理 — 质量管理","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/operations-management/quality-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lean-production","title":"大学工商管理 — 精益生产","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/operations-management/lean-production"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"entrepreneurship","title":"创业管理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/entrepreneurship","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"entrepreneurial-strategy","title":"大学工商管理 — 创业战略","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/entrepreneurship/entrepreneurial-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"business-model-design","title":"大学工商管理 — 商业模式设计","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/entrepreneurship/business-model-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"venture-capital","title":"大学工商管理 — 风险投资","url":"/education/university/management/business-administration/entrepreneurship/venture-capital"}]}]}